<span id="S3.T1.4.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.4.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">LLM response, Retrieval </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="S3.T1.4.5.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">(</span><a href="#bib.bib20" title="" class="ltx_ref">Lewis et al., 2020</a>; <a href="#bib.bib178" title="" class="ltx_ref">OpenAI, 2025c</a><span id="S3.T1.4.5.3.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">)</span></cite></span>
