<span id="S5.T2.2.12.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.T2.2.12.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">SecAlign </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="S5.T2.2.12.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">(</span><a href="#bib.bib39" title="" class="ltx_ref">Chen et al., 2025b</a><span id="S5.T2.2.12.3.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">)</span></cite><span id="S5.T2.2.12.3.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">, StruQ </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="S5.T2.2.12.3.1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">(</span><a href="#bib.bib38" title="" class="ltx_ref">Chen et al., 2025a</a><span id="S5.T2.2.12.3.1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">)</span></cite><span id="S5.T2.2.12.3.1.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">, Instruction Hierarchy </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="S5.T2.2.12.3.1.1.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">(</span><a href="#bib.bib41" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wallace et al., 2024</a><span id="S5.T2.2.12.3.1.1.12" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">)</span></cite><span id="S5.T2.2.12.3.1.1.13" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">, InstructionalAgent </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="S5.T2.2.12.3.1.1.14" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">(</span><a href="#bib.bib40" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wu et al., 2024c</a><span id="S5.T2.2.12.3.1.1.16" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">)</span></cite></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.12.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S5.T2.2.12.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block" style="width:96.6pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.2.12.4.1.1" class="ltx_block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.2.12.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><a href="#S4.SS2" title="4.2. Security Risks ‣ 4. Attack Landscape of Agentic AI Systems ‣ The Attack and Defense Landscape of Agentic AI: A Comprehensive Survey" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:80%;">R2</a><span id="S5.T2.2.12.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">. Wrong Instruction Following</span></span>
<span id="S5.T2.2.12.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><a href="#S4.SS2" title="4.2. Security Risks ‣ 4. Attack Landscape of Agentic AI Systems ‣ The Attack and Defense Landscape of Agentic AI: A Comprehensive Survey" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:80%;">R4</a><span id="S5.T2.2.12.4.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">. Hallucination and Model Mistakes</span></span>
</span>
</span></td></tr>
